            "lens": "review-risk",
            "findings": [],
            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed all 5 changed paths in full. The new fsstore Read validates the file name with checkName, reuses the same directory walk as Create, which refuses links on the way and returns ErrNotADirectory, and rejects invalid feature segments.",
              "readFile uses Lstat to refuse symlinks and non-regular files, opens the file, compares the opened file with the one looked at via SameFile to close the TOCTOU window, caps the read at MaxStoredBytes+1 through a LimitReader to bound memory, and re-checks the directories afterwards. Tests in engine/review/fsstore/read_test.go and engine/review/fsstore/read_internal_test.go exercise the traversal, link, oversize and race cases.",
              "No secrets, new dependencies or unsafe input handling were introduced. app.go changes are interface and doc additions only, and the fake in engine/review/app/fakes_test.go is test-only. No reachable exploit found."
            ]
          }
        }
